    "description": "Iowa RNG is a three-dairy renewable natural gas development in northwest Iowa led by Green Impact Partners. In February 2023 GIP announced a conditional strategic agreement under which Amber Infrastructure was expected to invest in 50% of the project. GIP's first-quarter 2023 financial statements continued to describe that interest as conditional and separately recorded only the GreenGas Colorado closing. GIP's second-quarter 2024 MD&A stated that Amber's exclusive Iowa RNG equity-funding rights expired on June 30, 2024 and had not been extended. GIP's Q3 2025 reporting and current project page continue to present Iowa RNG as a GIP development seeking financing. No official evidence was found that Amber's proposed Iowa RNG investment closed, so Amber is not represented as a current owner.",
